# Keep everything LF in the index, so a Windows clone can't change a byte that
# ends up inside the Linux container and shifts a pixel.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Baseline screenshots are not text: never normalise them. Deliberately NOT
# `binary` — that implies `-diff`, and the side-by-side image diff GitHub shows
# when a baseline changes is the whole point of reviewing this repo.
*.png -text
*.jpg -text
*.avif -text
